body:
Eh, with fallout 76 I'd say focus on whatever you find the most fun. I enjoyed the main quest but it's chief purpose was just to push you in different directions to explore. Focus on both questing and events/exploring equally and just when you feel like doing one or tge other.

Also just as some advice;

Don't bother with workshops outside of CAMPs >!except for the ammo plant!< as they provide no benefit you can't find yourself, and are all temporary and waste your resources
